{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"yululu-p-7f13f9ecdf1a12","name":"王靖","evidence":["yululu-q-3020760336a9e483ce73"],"facts":[],"mentions":[{"id":"yululu-m-23ec0486d13c3d748bee","kind":"mention","text":"骆统表言温弹之不私、推之不假，与靖遂为大怨","evidence":["yululu-q-3020760336a9e483ce73"]}],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"yululu-q-3020760336a9e483ce73","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-cc13454ec9d6ad18cae1","layer":"original","quote":"王靖内不忧时，外不趋事〖39〗；温弹之不私〖40〗，推之不假〖41〗。于是与靖遂为大怨，此其尽节之明验也〖42〗。靖兵众之势，干任之用，皆胜于贾原、蒋康；温尚不容私以安于靖，岂敢卖恩以协原、康邪〖43〗？又原在职不勤，当事不堪〖44〗；温数对以丑色〖45〗，弹以急声〖46〗：若其诚欲卖恩作乱，则亦不必贪原也〖47〗。","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":243,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":159,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
